OVERVIEW: Build and run an xtool SwiftPM project

USAGE: xtool dev <subcommand>

OPTIONS:
  --version               Show the version.
  -h, --help              Show help information.

SUBCOMMANDS:
  generate-xcode-project  Generate Xcode project
  build                   Build app with SwiftPM
  run (default)           Build and run app with SwiftPM
  build-server            Run build server

  See 'xtool help dev <subcommand>' for detailed help.
